{"lemma":"אַשְׁדּוֹדִי","translit":"ʼAshdôwdîy","pronunciation":"ash-do-dee'","def":"an Ashdodite (often collectively) or inhabitant of Asdod","kjv":"Ashdodites, of Ashdod.","occ":[[8,5,3,"And when they of Ashdod"],[8,5,6,"upon them of Ashdod"],[15,4,7,"and the Ashdodites"],[15,13,23,"of Ashdod"],[5,13,3,"and the Ashdothites"]]}